WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.000
My name is Dana.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.000
When I was in India, I broke my ankle,

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.600
so I had to fly home to Israel for urgent surgery.

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:15.400
I came back, saw a doctor and had surgery to repair the ankle,

5
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:22.000
and he told me recovery would take about two months, together with physiotherapy.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.600
Then I came across the electromagnetic pulse device,

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.400
and decided to try it alongside the physiotherapy.

8
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.600
I did that for three weeks,

9
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.400
and when I went back to the doctor, he said he had never seen such a fast recovery.

10
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.300
Thanks to the electromagnetic pulses, I was walking again

11
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.200
as fast as possible,

12
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.200
and now I'm traveling again.
